eployments. It emits no created outbox event.",[473,1030,1031,1032,1035],{},"Signup lines reference their plan and name their subscription in\n",[489,1033,1034],{},"relatedResources.subscriptionId","; renewal lines reference the subscription as\ntheir product. Both link the subscription to the checkout's billable.",[635,1037,1038,1050],{},[638,1039,1040],{},[641,1041,1042,1045,1047],{},[644,1043,1044],{},"Result field",[644,1046,649],{},[644,1048,1049],{},"What to do",[651,1051,1052,1065,1078,1094],{},[641,1053,1054,1059,1062],{},[656,1055,1056],{},[489,1057,1058],{},"subscriptions",[656,1060,1061],{},"Linked and stored subscriptions",[656,1063,1064],{},"Nothing",[641,1066,1067,1072,1075],{},[656,1068,1069],{},[489,1070,1071],{},"pending_subscription_ids",[656,1073,1074],{},"Referenced, but not readable yet",[656,1076,1077],{},"Reconcile again later",[641,1079,1080,1084,1091],{},[656,1081,1082],{},[489,1083,1016],{},[656,1085,1086,1087,1090],{},"Signup lines whose ",[489,1088,1089],{},"subscriptionId"," is still null",[656,1092,1093],{},"Reconcile again later; it may never resolve",[641,1095,1096,1101,1107],{},[656,1097,1098],{},[489,1099,1100],{},"legacy_plan_ids",[656,1102,1103,1104],{},"Plan lines on historical orders without ",[489,1105,1106],{},"relatedResources",[656,1108,1109],{},"Resolve manually",[473,1111,1112,1113,1116,1117,1119,1120,1122],{},"A signed ",[489,1114,1115],{},"order.paid"," snapshot is frozen when it is sent and can carry a null\n",[489,1118,1089],{},", so the first order may still need an explicit reconcile. Schedule\na bounded number of later reconciles while ",[489,1121,1016],{}," is not empty.\nNever guess by customer\u002Fplan\u002Fquantity. Missing subscription IDs remain pending,\nnot entitled. Trial flows may lack an order.paid event.",[473,1124,1125,1126,1129,1130,1137],{},"Grace expiry uses Fluent's shared mapper. ",[489,1127,1128],{},"canceledAt"," is the request time.\nMissing or ambiguous period deadlines raise and retain the prior committed state;\nmonitor and reconcile instead of inventing an expiry. Active snapshots clear stale\nends after resume. ",[1131,1132,1136],"a",{"href":1133,"rel":1134},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fpackages\u002Ffluent-python\u002Fsubscriptions",[1135],"nofollow","Fluent's guide","\ndescribes this policy and its limits.",[473,1139,1140],{},[1131,1141,1144],{"href":1142,"rel":1143},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference\u002Fsubscriptions",[1135],"Subscription API reference",[1146,1147,1148],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .sHdIc, html code.shiki .sHdIc{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#BABED8;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6B;--shiki-dark:#FFCB6B}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--